    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ventilate is a top-down isometric shooter set in a steampunk city where constructs, helpful machines used for all sorts of roles, have gone rogue. It's a single-player bullet hell, set in a steam punk world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Powers Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than ammo, all your guns and gadgets are powered by steam pressure, which must be recharged at vents around the map. Constructs are also powered by steam pressure and have to recharge their steam with the same vents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Award Nominations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nominated for best upcoming game in the IMIRT Irish Game Awards in 2025, you play as Rosalyn, a construction worker and must blast her way to survival and make it back to your family and get out of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364220/extras/19f23b36bc127c532f65c307372e505c.avif?t=1752934180\" width=600 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ventilate is a top-down isometric shooter set in a steampunk city where constructs, helpful machines used for all sorts of roles, have gone rogue. It's a single-player bullet hell, set in a steam punk world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Powers Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than ammo, all your guns and gadgets are powered by steam pressure, which must be recharged at vents around the map. Constructs are also powered by steam pressure and have to recharge their steam with the same vents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Award Nominations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nominated for best upcoming game in the IMIRT Irish Game Awards in 2025, you play as Rosalyn, a construction worker and must blast her way to survival and make it back to your family and get out of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364220/extras/19f23b36bc127c532f65c307372e505c.avif?t=1752934180\" width=600 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
